<title>RUSSIA: Russian March inflation 1.4 pct vs 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian March inflation 1.4 pct vs 1.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's monthly consumer price inflation slowed in March to 1.4 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    MAR 97    FEB 97    MAR 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +1.4	+1.5	+2.8</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    N/A     +18.1     +78.7</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
